Code.Terraform:
```hcl
resource "azurerm_application_gateway" "example_resource" {
  # ...existing gateway configuration, without a waf_configuration block
  sku {
    name = "WAF_v2" # Critical: WAF tier
    tier = "WAF_v2"
  }
  firewall_policy_id                = azurerm_web_application_firewall_policy.example_resource.id # Critical: associates the WAF policy
  force_firewall_policy_association = true # Replaces a legacy WAF configuration with the policy
}
```
